### PRUEBA SISTEMA DE IMÁGENES CON RANAPB.PNG

# Variables
@gateway_url = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 2a36ca84-0166-46b2-80b4-0838987388bf

### PASO 1: Obtener Token
# @name auth
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/proyect-ms-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=user-ms-client&client_secret=Aq3vK9EfTGwoWpK3j48RkN6Q0yCUZqGd&username=laura.martinez@gmail.com&password=password123

### PASO 2: Listar usuarios (usa el token del paso anterior)
GET {{gateway_url}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.access_token}}

### PASO 3: Verificar imagen actual (debe dar 404)
GET {{gateway_url}}/api/images/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.access_token}}

### PASO 4: SUBIR IMAGEN RANAPB.PNG
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/users/{{userId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ranapb.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./ranapb.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### PASO 5: Verificar imagen subida (debe devolver la imagen)
GET {{gateway_url}}/api/images/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.access_token}}

### PASO 6: Verificar usuario actualizado
GET {{gateway_url}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.access_token}}